---
import { site } from '../data/site';

const [main, ...side] = site.testimonials;
---

<section class="voices section section--line" id="voces">
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>06 — Voces</p>
        <h2 class="section-title" data-split>
          Lo que queda<br />
          <em>después del viaje.</em>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-head__aside" data-reveal>
        Palabras de quienes caminaron conmigo. Al final, la foto es solo una
        forma de recordar lo que ya estaba ahí.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="voices__grid">
      <div class="voices__main">
        <span class="voices__mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
        <blockquote class="voices__quote" data-reveal>{main.quote}</blockquote>
        <p class="voices__person">
          <strong>{main.name}</strong>
          <span>{main.detail}</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="voices__side">
        {side.map((testimonial) => (
          <blockquote data-reveal>
            <p>“{testimonial.quote}”</p>
            <footer>{testimonial.name} · {testimonial.detail}</footer>
          </blockquote>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
